        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "## Language adherence\nFor a monolingual requirement, an unexplained paragraph in another language counts against adherence. Check the requested output language and context first. Ordinary loanwords are not automatically code-switching errors; a user mixing languages does not itself define the required output language."
      }
